{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09150","headline":"送宣州周录事 · 韦应物","name":"送宣州周录事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清时重儒士，纠郡属伊人。\n薄游长安中，始得一交亲。\n英豪若云集，饯别塞城闉。\n高驾临长路，日夕起风尘。\n方念清宵宴，已度芳林春。\n从兹一分手，缅邈吴与秦。\n但覩年运驶，安知後会因。\n唯当存令德，可以解悁勤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09150.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09150","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}